<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31193" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰρην-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for peace</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγων -ώτατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					5.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1254b32
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυσίαι</span>
			<i>peace</i> offerings, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>1 Ki.</u>
				11.15
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγγελοι καὶ δαίμονες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herm.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.49.45
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of</i> or <i>in peace, peaceful</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος, πρᾶξις</span>, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				829a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				399b
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστῆμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					1.17
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.634
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>
			<i>peaceably</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολεμικῶς</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				5.46
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Hom.</u>
				p.45
			</span></i> O., etc.: 
				Comp.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώτερον</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Fug.</u>
				5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>peaceable</i>, of persons, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				2.24
			</span></i>.</div>
